t season at professional level. However, following the relegation of their parent club, PVF-CAND, to V.League 2, the two teams could not compete in the same division as both share the same legal entity.\r\n\r\nIn July 2026, the club's ownership was transferred to KBC Vietnam Technology Joint Stock Company. On 22 July 2026, the People's Committee of Hưng Yên province authorized the team to adopt the name Hưng Yên Football Club.","strDescriptionDE":null,"strDescriptionFR":null,"strDescriptionCN":null,"strDescriptionIT":null,"strDescriptionJP":null,"strDescriptionRU":null,"strDescriptionES":null,"strDescriptionPT":null,"strDescriptionSE":null,"strDescriptionNL":null,"strDescriptionHU":null,"strDescriptionNO":null,"strDescriptionIL":null,"strDescriptionPL":null,"strColour1":"","strColour2":"","strColour3":"","strGender":"Male","strCountry":"Vietnam","strBadge":"https://r2.thesportsdb.com/images/media/team/badge/2s9ght1786902977.png","strLogo":null,"strFanart1":null,"strFanart2":null,"strFanart3":null,"strFanart4":null,"strBanner":null,"strEquipment":null,"strYoutube":"","strLocked":"unlocked"},{"idTeam":"142833","idESPN":"0","idAPIfootball":"3677","intLoved":null,"strTeam":"Khánh Hòa","strTeamAlternate":"Khatoco Khanh Hoa Football Club, Câu lạc bộ Bóng đá Khatoco Khánh Hòa","strTeamShort":"","intFormedYear":"2013","strSport":"Soccer","strLeague":"Vietnam V.League 2","idLeague":"5214","strLeague2":"Vietnamese Cup","idLeague2":"5200","strLeague3":"","idLeague3":null,"strLeague4":"","idLeague4":null,"strLeague5":"","idLeague5":null,"strLeague6":"","idLeague6":null,"strLeague7":"","idLeague7":null,"strDivision":null,"idVenue":"20576","strStadium":"Sân vận động 19 tháng 8","strKeywords":"","strRSS":"","strLocation":"Khánh Hòa Province, Vietnam","strWebsite":"","strFacebook":"","strTwitter":"","strInstagram":"","strDescriptionEN":"Khatoco Khanh Hoa Football Club (Vietnamese: Câu lạc bộ Bóng đá Khatoco Khánh Hòa) simply known as Khánh Hòa, is a professional football club based